      "solutionSteps": [
        "(I)求y(x).\nx> 0,原方程xy' -6y= -6 化为标准形\ny' -6\nxy= -6\nx,\np(x) = -6\nx.\n积分因子\\mu = e\\int (-6/x) dx= e-6 ln x= x-6.两边同乘:\n(yx-6)\n' = x-6(y' -6\nxy) = -6x-7.\n积分(\\int -6x-7 dx= -6 ⋅x-6\n-6 = x-6 + C):\nyx-6 = x-6 + C⟹y= 1 + Cx6.\n由y(\n\\sqrt{3}) = 10:1 + C(\n\\sqrt{3})\n6 = 1 + 27C= 10,故C= 1\n3.所以\ny(x) = 1 + x6\n(x> 0).\n验证.y' = 2x5,则xy' -6y= 2x6 -6 -2x6 = -6;且y(\n\\sqrt{3}) = 1 + 27\n3 = 10.方程与初值都对.\n(也可分离变量:dy\ny-1 = 6 dx\nx\n\\implies ln |y-1| = 6 ln x+ C1 \\implies y-1 = Cx6,结果相同.)\n(II)求使Ip最小的点p.\n设p= (t, y(t)) = (t, 1 + t6\n3 ),t> 0.切线斜率y'(t) = 2t5 > 0,故法线斜率为\nk= -\ny'(t) = -\\frac{1}{2}t5 .\n法线方程\nY-y(t) = -\\frac{1}{2}t5 (X-t).\n令X= 0 得y轴截距\nIp= y(t) +\nt\n2t5 = 1 + t6\n3 + \\frac{1}{2}t4 =∶I(t),\nt> 0.\n求导:\nI'(t) = 2t5 -4\n2t5 = 2t5 -2\nt5 = 2(t10 -1)\nt5\n.\n(其中d\ndt(\\frac{1}{2}t-4) = -2t-5.)在t> 0 上分母恒正,故I'(t) 与t10 -1 同号:\n0 < t< 1 \\implies I'(t) < 0;\nt= 1 \\implies I'(t) = 0;\nt> 1 \\implies I'(t) > 0.\n所以I(t) 在(0, 1] 上单调减、在[1, +\\infty ) 上单调增,t= 1 是唯一驻点且为最小值点.(端点无\n碍:t\\to 0+ 时I\\to +\\infty ,t\\to +\\infty 时I\\to +\\infty .)\n此时\ny(1) = 1 + 1\n3 = 4\n3,\nImin = 1 + 1\n3 + \\frac{1}{2} = 11\n6 .\n故所求点为\np= (1, 4\n3)\n(此时Ip= 11\n6 ).\n24.1\n一阶方程:可分离、齐次、线性、伯努利"
      ],
