        "第4步:)\n(II)先记住(I)中的关键事实:r1, r2 < 0,所以\n\\lim_{x\\to +\\infty} y(x) = 0,\n\\lim_{x\\to +\\infty} y'(x) =\n\\lim_{x\\to +\\infty} (C1r1er1x + C2r2er2x) = 0.\n把方程y'' + 2y' + ky = 0 在[0, A] 上积分(y''、y' 连续,可逐项积分):\n\\int A\ny'' dx + 2\n\\int A\ny' dx + k\n\\int A\ny dx = 0,\n由牛顿–莱布尼茨公式,\n[\ny'(A) -y'(0)\n]\n+ 2 [y(A) -y(0)] + k\n\\int A\ny(x) dx = 0.\n令A \\to +\\infty ,由上面两个极限为0,并代入y(0) = 1、y'(0) = 1:\n-y'(0) -2y(0) + k\n\\int +\\infty \ny(x) dx = 0 =\\implies -1 -2 + k\n\\int +\\infty \ny(x) dx = 0.\n因k \\ne 0,得\n\\int +\\infty \ny(x) dx = 3\nk.\n验证(直接解出来核对).由y(0) = 1、y'(0) = 1 定常数:C1 + C2 = 1,C1r1 + C2r2 = 1。"
