        "第四步:代入数值.在(1, 1) 处z = 0,\\partial z \\partial x = 1,ez + x = 1 + 1 = 2,于是 2 · \\partial 2z \\partial x2 (1,1) = -1 · 12 -2 · 1 = -3 =\\implies \\partial 2z \\partial x2 (1,1) = -3",
