        "第2步:由t = \\theta /x 得dt = -\\theta \nx2 dx,即\\frac{1}{x}2 dx = -1\n\\theta dt,于是\n\\int +\\infty \nx2 e-\\theta \nx dx =\n\\int 0\n+\\infty \ne-t\n(\n-1\n\\theta \n)\ndt = 1\n\\theta \n\\int +\\infty \ne-t dt = 1\n\\theta .\n故\nE(X) = \\theta 2 · 1\n\\theta = \\theta .\n(顺带验证密度确实归一:同样代换给\n\\int +\\infty \n\\theta 2\nx3 e-\\theta \nx dx =\n\\int +\\infty \nte-t dt = Γ(2) = 1,✓。",
